From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 10:10:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Make tab expansion pen-aware throughout layout

- Skip tab-specific work when no shaped run contains a tab.
- Derive tab advances from each fitting and intrinsic-width pen before
  line commit.
- Share tab-stop arithmetic with commit-time glyph expansion so repeated
  breaks are stable.
- Subtract the actual pen-derived advance when trimming trailing tabs.
- Keep fallback glyph handling for fonts without a space glyph.
